  "scope": "0.10.1-claudegpt.23: stage 2 slice 4 of the Rust migration. Additive PTY host protocol service state=1 (no protocol bump): state.read { file } -> { revision, content|null } and state.write { file, content, revision, backup } -> { revision } or conflict; temp file + fsync + rename with retry, .bak copied only when reframe vouches for the file there, compare-and-set on a per-host revision that also detects changes on disk; content opaque (zod schema and migrations stay in TypeScript); rust/reframe-services state.rs and the Node host's src/main/state/files.ts; StateStore writes through the host when the welcome advertises state (serialized, newest-state-wins, re-read on conflict, in-process fallback, settle before letting the host go and before exit), loads in-process as before; byte-compatible file. Host service requests queue (8 running, 64 waiting) instead of answering busy at 8. Tray: Terminate all sessions + Quit replace Quit (sessions keep running) and End sessions and quit. Claude quota from LLM Coordinator usage.snapshot providers[] when the user's own status line prevents capture; capture preferred unless the Coordinator observed later; codex from providers with buckets fallback",
